abstract: >-
  AI Baby Gorilla is a free one-page JSON-LD entity connection and
  minimum identity checker developed by Sydney Business Web. It examines
  whether structured entities on a public webpage form a coherent
  machine-readable identity graph and reports missing, fragmented or
  isolated identity signals.

keywords:
  - "JSON-LD"
  - "Schema.org"
  - "entity graph"
  - "structured data"
  - "machine-readable identity"
  - "AI visibility"

